{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/block/buzz/pulls/5695","id":4265412147,"node_id":"PR_kwDORgXb2s7-PQYz","html_url":"https://github.com/block/buzz/pull/5695","diff_url":"https://github.com/block/buzz/pull/5695.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/block/buzz/pull/5695.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/block/buzz/issues/5695","number":5695,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(buzz-acp): make resolved relay URL authoritative for ACP child sp…","user":{"login":"azhodl","id":87045063,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MDQ1MDYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87045063?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/azhodl","html_url":"https://github.com/azhodl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azhodl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azhodl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azhodl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azhodl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azhodl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azhodl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azhodl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azhodl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azhodl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"…awns\r\n\r\nA child spawned by AcpClient::spawn inherited the parent environment and only received persona env vars under operator-wins semantics, so with a missing or stale parent BUZZ_RELAY_URL it silently fell back to the ws://localhost:3000 default and died with \"404 no community for this host\" after consuming the mention. The mention is lost: the harness has already taken the work, and the child never reaches the relay to reply.\r\n\r\nThis is reachable whenever the operator passes --relay-url without also exporting BUZZ_RELAY_URL, which the flag's existence invites.\r\n\r\n- config.rs: Config::from_args pushes the resolved relay URL (CLI over env over default, per clap) into persona_env_vars, so every pool spawn/respawn path carries it. Preflight: an unparseable relay URL now fails terminally (missing-config) before the harness subscribes or takes work; the error prints only the URL, never keys.\r\n- acp.rs: AcpClient::spawn force-sets BUZZ_RELAY_URL from extra_env, overriding both missing and stale parent env. All other keys keep operator-wins semantics.\r\n- Tests: child-env probe for unset-parent and stale-parent scenarios; full-chain CLI-to-PoolStartup extra_env test; missing-config preflight test.\r\n\r\nNo unsafe. New unwrap()/expect() calls are confined to #[cfg(test)] modules.\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n<!-- What does this change and why? -->\r\n\r\n### Related issue\r\n<!-- Fixes #1234, or N/A. Before opening: search existing issues/PRs for duplicates — link the closest one, or say \"none found\". -->\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n<!-- How was this verified? UI change? Include before/after screenshots (or a short recording). -->\r\n","created_at":"2026-08-12T19:33:35Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T19:33:36Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"990b9ba4327e253495649c8d3e2334507e89a9a8","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/block/buzz/pulls/5695/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/block/buzz/pulls/5695/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/block/buzz/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/block/buzz/issues/5695/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/block/buzz/statuses/e7bcfea791c41b298754e608b3984598341ea3b5","head":{"label":"azhodl:acp-child-relay-url","ref":"acp-child-relay-url","sha":"e7bcfea791c41b298754e608b3984598341ea3b5","user":{"login":"azhodl","id":87045063,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MDQ1MDYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserco